Modified. The modifications are enumerated in the module docstring of
`src/nexus/vendor/ddtrace_module/module.py`: the three `ddtrace.internal`
imports are replaced with stdlib equivalents, the `LazyWrappingContext`/`lazy`
helpers are removed, and the two private markers `__dd_origin__` /
`_dd_get_code` are renamed to `__nexus_origin__` / `_nexus_get_code` so that a
process running both ddtrace and nexus does not have the two SDKs contend over
one attribute.
